{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐细节和感官层次明显不如X，许多具体的声部、节奏、音色变化被压缩成了比较概括的情绪词。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句和分段感受更适合在有限时间里扫读，音乐描写也更细腻具体，但感受词过密，人物心理发展的因果关系有时需要观众自己补足。Y虽然左栏长句在短停留时间内比较费读，却把人物为什么靠近、为什么退缩、为什么重新获得勇气，以及为什么最终接受不确定性讲得更连贯、更容易理解。综合来看，作为普通观众，我更容易通过Y理解并记住这段关系的完整变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a4687274-c24a-48d4-afbb-45f4fca32635", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T161933409416Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T16:20:27.481516+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b7049b78565fdfa5c87ae517b1a3df1abf33b4396900b2e3cc4d7d1e2c774972", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "